@startuml core-flow-sequence
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title LUỒNG NGHIỆP VỤ TRỤ CỘT: TẠO ĐƠN - THANH TOÁN - PHUN HƯƠNG TỰ ĐỘNG

actor "Khách hàng Kiosk" as Customer
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "Identity Service" as IdentitySvc
participant "Machine Service" as MachineSvc
participant "Catalog Service" as CatalogSvc
database "Order DB" as OrderDB
participant "Cổng thanh toán" as PaymentGw
participant "Kiosk Hardware" as Hardware

== GIAI ĐOẠN 1: TẠO ĐƠN HÀNG AUTHORITATIVE ==
Customer -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/orders\n{tenantId, machineId, slotId, items: [{productId, unitPrice}]}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> OrderSvc: Forward POST /api/v1/orders
activate OrderSvc

OrderSvc -> IdentitySvc: POST /internal/v1/identity/introspect (Validate Bearer Token)
activate IdentitySvc
IdentitySvc --> OrderSvc: 200 OK (IdentityPrincipal: customerId, tenantId, grants: KIOSK_ORDER)
deactivate IdentitySvc

OrderSvc -> MachineSvc: GET /internal/v1/machines/{mId}/slots/{sId}\n(Header: X-Internal-Service-Key)
activate MachineSvc
MachineSvc --> OrderSvc: MachineSlotSnapshot\n{machineAvailable: true, slotAvailable: true, productId: "202"}
deactivate MachineSvc

OrderSvc -> CatalogSvc: GET /internal/v1/catalog/products/202/order-snapshot
activate CatalogSvc
CatalogSvc --> OrderSvc: CatalogProductSnapshot\n{productId: 202, active: true, authoritativePrice: 50000}
deactivate CatalogSvc

OrderSvc -> OrderSvc: Đối soát dữ liệu:\n1. Giá Client gửi == Giá Authoritative\n2. Sản phẩm trùng khớp cấu hình Slot\n3. Trạng thái máy & slot đều ACTIVE
OrderSvc -> OrderDB: INSERT INTO orders (status='PENDING', total_amount=50000, expires_at=NOW()+15m)\nINSERT INTO order_items (...)
activate OrderDB
OrderDB --> OrderSvc: Saved Order (ID = 9001)
deactivate OrderDB

OrderSvc --> Gateway: 201 Created {orderId: 9001, status: "PENDING", totalAmount: 50000}
deactivate OrderSvc
Gateway --> Customer: 201 Created {orderId: 9001}
deactivate Gateway

== GIAI ĐOẠN 2: TẠO MÃ QR VÀ QUÉT THANH TOÁN ==
Customer -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/orders/9001/payments (Lấy mã QR)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> OrderSvc: Forward Get QR
activate OrderSvc
OrderSvc -> OrderDB: INSERT INTO payments (reference='PAY-9001-XYZ', amount=50000, status='PENDING')
OrderSvc --> Gateway: 200 OK {reference: 'PAY-9001-XYZ', qrPayload: 'scentstation://pay/...'}
deactivate OrderSvc
Gateway --> Customer: 200 OK (Hiển thị mã QR VietQR)
deactivate Gateway

Customer -> PaymentGw: Quét mã trên App Ngân hàng & Chuyển tiền

== GIAI ĐOẠN 3: WEBHOOK CALLBACK VÀ ĐIỀU PHỐI PHUN HƯƠNG ==
PaymentGw -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/payments/callback\n{eventId: 'EVT-888', reference: 'PAY-9001-XYZ', amount: 50000, status: 'PAID'}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> OrderSvc: Forward Callback (Header: X-Callback-Token)
activate OrderSvc

OrderSvc -> OrderSvc: Xác thực chữ ký Callback & Kiểm tra Idempotency
OrderSvc -> OrderDB: UPDATE payments SET status='PAID', paid_at=NOW()\nUPDATE orders SET status='CONFIRMED'\nINSERT INTO payment_callback_events (eventId, outcome='ACCEPTED')
OrderSvc -> OrderDB: INSERT INTO dispensing_commands (commandId: UUID, status='REQUESTED')

OrderSvc -> MachineSvc: POST /internal/v1/machines/{mId}/dispense\n{commandId: UUID, orderId: 9001, slotId: sId}
activate MachineSvc

MachineSvc -> Hardware: Kích xung điện bơm màng (Relay ON -> Pulse 2.5ml)
activate Hardware
Hardware --> MachineSvc: Cảm biến quang/lưu lượng xác nhận tia phun OK
deactivate Hardware

MachineSvc --> OrderSvc: 200 OK {commandId: UUID, status: 'DISPENSED'}
deactivate MachineSvc

OrderSvc -> OrderDB: UPDATE dispensing_commands SET status='DISPENSED'\nUPDATE orders SET status='DISPENSED'

OrderSvc --> Gateway: 200 OK {status: 'SUCCESS'}
deactivate OrderSvc
Gateway --> PaymentGw: 200 OK
deactivate Gateway

== GIAI ĐOẠN 4: KHÁCH HÀNG NHẬN HƯƠNG TẠI KIOSK ==
Customer -> Hardware: Đặt cổ tay/que thử tại họng xịt và nhận tia nước hoa thơm mát!

@enduml
